  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"article-title\" id=\"article-title\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6896635a\" id=\"u6896635a\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">电机模块</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"udd23c0a4\" id=\"udd23c0a4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9192607e\" id=\"u9192607e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">采用N20电机，电机上有两个触点，通电就可以转动。我们采用的N20电机的额定电压为6V，最大转速是300RPM（300圈/分钟）</span><span data-lake-id=\"u831be1c5\" id=\"u831be1c5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /><br /></span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u125df31a\" id=\"u125df31a\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1682640069443-d705b677-fb53-4882-af54-ce25c5a6549c.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fwatermark%252Ctype_d3F5LW1pY3JvaGVp%252Csize_15%252Ctext_6buR6ams56iL5bqP5ZGY%252Ccolor_FFFFFF%252Cshadow_50%252Ct_80%252Cg_se%252Cx_10%252Cy_10%252Fformat%252Cwebp%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A513%2C%22originHeight%22%3A392%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23000000%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LXIf2%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" class=\"lake-fontsize-9\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"uef42b123\" id=\"uef42b123\"><span data-lake-id=\"uda82b598\" id=\"uda82b598\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /><br /></span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u015740f1\" id=\"u015740f1\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1688889360092-52030922-2b5f-40d1-ae04-dcd6d3679b9d.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fwatermark%252Ctype_d3F5LW1pY3JvaGVp%252Csize_16%252Ctext_6buR6ams56iL5bqP5ZGY%252Ccolor_FFFFFF%252Cshadow_50%252Ct_80%252Cg_se%252Cx_10%252Cy_10%252Fformat%252Cwebp%252Fresize%252Cw_565%252Climit_0%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A565%2C%22originHeight%22%3A482%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e2e5e6%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MP9Nk%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" class=\"lake-fontsize-9\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4a761214\" id=\"u4a761214\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1d386ab1\" id=\"u1d386ab1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /><br /></span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7fe7fe48\" id=\"u7fe7fe48\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1688892034981-90c28de2-f40e-4079-a0b6-2c3481bba79d.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fwatermark%252Ctype_d3F5LW1pY3JvaGVp%252Csize_23%252Ctext_6buR6ams56iL5bqP5ZGY%252Ccolor_FFFFFF%252Cshadow_50%252Ct_80%252Cg_se%252Cx_10%252Cy_10%252Fformat%252Cwebp%252Fresize%252Cw_822%252Climit_0%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A822%2C%22originHeight%22%3A373%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23d5dbe7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mT2y3%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" class=\"lake-fontsize-9\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"uaba0b9fa\" id=\"uaba0b9fa\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7d083606\" id=\"u7d083606\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br />通电的时候，无论正接还是反接，电机都可以转动，只是转动的方向不同。<br />注意：<br />●减速电机请尽量避免堵转或者超负载，否则会出现崩齿轮损耗。<br />●正反转控制时，不要让齿轮在传动中立刻切换转向，建议在完全停止后切换转向<br />两个电机分别对应一个电机驱动芯片，通过电机驱动芯片进行驱动电机转动。<br />电机驱动芯片又是通过两路pwm来控制的。<br /></span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u63162cd3\" id=\"u63162cd3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\">两个引脚分别对应了采用互补的方式，可以驱动电机，达到电机可以正转反转的效果。</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u34956977\" id=\"u34956977\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br />电机驱动帮助我们解决了正反转动态切换的问题<br /></span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8ad52251\" id=\"u8ad52251\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">N20电机参数</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ucd4167f0\" id=\"ucd4167f0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /><br /></span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u265a2720\" id=\"u265a2720\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1688888819239-244eb8e2-197f-4a52-865e-e9be22397dd1.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fwatermark%252Ctype_d3F5LW1pY3JvaGVp%252Csize_21%252Ctext_6buR6ams56iL5bqP5ZGY%252Ccolor_FFFFFF%252Cshadow_50%252Ct_80%252Cg_se%252Cx_10%252Cy_10%252Fformat%252Cwebp%252Fresize%252Cw_750%252Climit_0%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A750%2C%22originHeight%22%3A633%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f5f5f5%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TXR4S%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" class=\"lake-fontsize-9\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"></ca